# <type>[scope]: <subject> [#issue_id]
#
# Subject line ≤ 50 chars, no trailing period, imperative mood.
#
# Types: feat | fix | refactor | docs | chore | style | perf | vendor
#
# --- body (optional, wrap at 72 chars) ---
#
# Explain WHY the change is needed, not what (the diff shows what).
#
# --- footer (optional) ---
#
# Closes #<id>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
# Co-Authored-By: Name <email>
